n subject to the jurisdiction o f the U n ited  States \nwho, alone or together w ith one or more affiliated persons, owns or  \nacquires as much as a 1 0 %  interest in the voting securities, capital or  \nearnings o f a foreign  business venture is prohibited on or after the  \neffective date o f this O rder, except as expressly authorized by the  \nSecretary o f Com m erce, from  engaging in any transaction involving  \na direct or indirect transfer o f capit","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_11387.txt","sha256":"ec9fbba57fd192921e0f14d315dbf699e4679581a6b131d9cccd6fc465f67b5e","source":{"line":1242,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"c21072453889771999f54e8016b35b8968b746f29856c57a699fbffde12fbd38"}}]}
